{
  "id": "toluene___thermophysical_properties",
  "title": "Toluene - Thermophysical Properties Calculator",
  "description": "A comprehensive calculator for toluene thermophysical properties at 25°C (298 K) and 1 bara. Toluene (C₆H₅-CH₃) is a clear colorless liquid with high flammability, used in aviation and automotive fuels, as well as a solvent. This tool provides access to critical temperature, density, viscosity, heat capacity, and other thermophysical properties with unit conversions.",
